      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4274,
      "text": "‘Ayyn Sīn Qāf[1].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 483,
      "ruku": 419,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4275,
      "text": "This is how Allah, the Al-Mighty, the All-Wise, sends revelation to you [O Prophet] and to those before you.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 483,
      "ruku": 419,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4276,
      "text": "To him belongs all that is in the heavens and all that is on earth, and He is the Most High, the Most Great.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 483,
      "ruku": 419,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4277,
      "text": "The heavens almost burst apart above them[2], and the angels glorify the praises of their Lord and seek forgiveness for those on earth. Indeed, Allah is the All-Forgiving, the Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 483,
      "ruku": 419,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4278,
      "text": "As for those who take others as protectors besides Him, Allah is Watchful over them, and you[3] are not a keeper over them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 483,
      "ruku": 419,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4279,
      "text": "Thus We have revealed to you an Arabic Qur’an, so that you may warn the Mother Town[4] and all those around it[5], and warn them of the Day of Gathering, about which there is no doubt; one party will be in Paradise and the other in the Blaze.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 483,
      "ruku": 419,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4280,
      "text": "If Allah had willed, He would have made all of them a single community, but He admits to His mercy whom He wills[6], and the wrongdoers will have no protector or helper.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 483,
      "ruku": 419,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4281,
      "text": "How do they take protectors besides Him? While Allah alone is the Protector, for He gives life to the dead, and He is Most Capable of all things.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 483,
      "ruku": 419,
      "hizbQuarter": 193,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4282,
      "text": "Whatever you may differ about, it is for Allah to judge. Such is Allah, my Lord; in Whom I put my trust, and to Whom I turn[7],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 42,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّورَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shura",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Consultation",
        "numberOfAyahs": 53,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
